flowchart LR
    A[Push to GitHub] --> B[Run Tests]
    B --> C{Tests Pass?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Build Docker Image]
    C -->|No| E[Notify Developer]
    D --> F[Push to Registry]
    F --> G[Deploy to Staging]
    G --> H{Manual Approval}
    H -->|Approved| I[Deploy to Production]
    H -->|Rejected| E
